WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:03.105
Unit nineteen. Helping Others!

2
00:00:04.112 --> 00:00:09.099
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English!

3
00:00:09.149 --> 00:00:12.906
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.956 --> 00:00:16.438
Today we learn: Helping Others. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.697 --> 00:00:20.830
Help. Say it with me. Help!

6
00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:27.808
Kindness. Say it with me. Kindness!

7
00:00:31.339 --> 00:00:35.006
Generous. Say it with me. Generous!

8
00:00:38.529 --> 00:00:42.429
Volunteer. Say it with me. Volunteer!

9
00:00:45.927 --> 00:00:49.727
Community. Say it with me. Community!

10
00:00:53.184 --> 00:00:56.401
Care. Say it with me. Care!

11
00:00:59.924 --> 00:01:03.391
Support. Say it with me. Support!

12
00:01:06.873 --> 00:01:09.973
Give. Say it with me. Give!

13
00:01:13.488 --> 00:01:23.391
Grammar time! Gerunds as subjects. Listen. Helping others feels good. Volunteering builds community.

14
00:01:23.441 --> 00:01:30.013
Your turn. Say it with me. Helping others feels good. Volunteering builds community.

15
00:01:35.037 --> 00:01:46.843
Helping others brings real kindness into the world. Being generous with your time, like volunteering in your community, shows that you care. Small acts of support can make a big difference.

16
00:01:46.893 --> 00:01:48.268
I like this story!

17
00:01:49.457 --> 00:01:54.830
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.030
Generous!

19
00:01:57.019 --> 00:02:02.269
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:02.319 --> 00:02:03.469
Support!

21
00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:13.438
Think and answer. Describe a time you helped someone. How did it feel?

22
00:02:13.488 --> 00:02:14.638
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.919 --> 00:02:18.589
This unit's value is Kindness.

24
00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:21.139
I can show kindness every day!

25
00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:29.076
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Secondary Level one. See you in Level two. Goodbye!

26
00:02:29.126 --> 00:02:32.650
Thank you, Teacher Vibol! See you in Level 2!

